    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the professionals... they don't get it. they tell you \"it's just a job\" or \"you can always start over.\" but they didn't have what i had. i built an entire life on that reputation. now that it's stripped away, there's nothing left to build with. it's not just a bad patch, it feels like the end of the story. like the book is just finished.",
